# Rejected section photos — banned forever

Hard rule for diana’s dashboard (`/Users/diana/my-dashboard`) section / zone photos.

## Once rejected = forever banned

When Diana rejects a section photo, it is **BANNED forever**. Never re-apply it from:

- Old one-shot migrations / `localStorage` MKEY leftovers
- `MAP` / `IMG` caches / `KNOWN_CARD_PHOTOS` / bake data
- “Restore previous” / “nopeople” / earlier conceptual attempts
- Archive copies under `manus-storage/archive/`

## Conceptual sections (soul, sorrow, darkness, abundance, attention)

**soul ≠ sorrow.** They are distinct foci. Never alias sorrow → soul (or soul → sorrow) in IMG maps, KEYWORDS, migrations, apply scripts, or photo assignment. Do not caption the soul tile as sorrow. Do not auto-create a sorrow section just because soul exists. `zone-sorrow.jpg` was only a duplicate of the soul rose — do not use sorrow naming on the soul asset (`zone-soul.jpg?v=soul2`).

- **No faces / photoreal people** on these conceptual tiles (person-in-storm, person-at-window with a visible person) — see also `no-other-faces-or-names`. **Woman silhouettes are OK** going forward unless that specific silhouette asset was rejected
- **No candles / flames** after the candle rejection (soul especially; sorrow if/when it has its own photo)
- Prefer conceptual still-lifes: spotlight/magnifier (attention), void rainy window (darkness), wilted rose rainy sill (**soul** only — not “soul/sorrow”)
- **- **to love wedding rings (`zone-to-love-rings`) is BANNED** — romantic marriage imagery. to love = loving other human souls / biofield, not romance. Leave nophoto rather than restoring rings or aurora.
**- **to feel rain-on-window (`zone-to-feel-rain`) is BANNED** — feeling is human/bodily, not weather metaphor. Never restore rain glass.
**to persevere mountain peaks (`zone-to-persevere-peaks`) is BANNED** — perseverance is human determination/conviction, not mountains. Never restore peaks.
- Abundance wheat is BANNED forever:** `zone-abundance.jpg?v=plenty2`, any `zone-abundance` / wheat harvest / `abundance-wheat-sunset` / plenty assets were **rejected**. Never restore them. Abundance may stay **nophoto / black** until a **NEW** non-rejected photo is assigned (new filename + APPROVED map entry) — empty is correct after rejection. Do not “fix” by re-applying wheat or any AI cinematic surplus still-life.
- **to channel abstract orb (`zone-to-channel.jpg?v=field1` / luminous single-core field without shared souls) is BANNED** — it did not read as shared energy / biofield / souls in the same field. Never restore it.
- **Exception:** audacity finger silhouette is Diana-supplied — do **not** ban it

## When replacing

1. Bump cache `?v=` **and** migration `MKEY` so older one-shots cannot leave stale candle/people/wheat winning
2. Archive the rejected asset; never point live MAP / IMG / `serve.py` at it
3. Keep `everything.html` + `prototype.html` + `serve.py` in sync
4. Runtime `REJECTED_SECTION_PHOTOS` banlist must scrub banned URL substrings → approved WANT URLs (or **nophoto** when there is no approved replacement, as with abundance after wheat)

## If a rejected image returns

Complaint = instruction. Scrub banlist + force the approved URL (or clear to nophoto) immediately. Do not ask permission.
